{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","海螺号角"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤皇家近卫并使其分摊伤害保护友军。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，战斗开始时，佩吉召唤2名“皇家近卫”加入战斗，“皇家近卫”继承佩吉120% + 16%的生命值和50% + 7%的攻击力。若佩吉被击败，全部卫兵会立刻撤离战场。\n主动释放时：佩吉吹响号角，使在场的“皇家近卫”立刻回复相当于其最大生命值的生命，保护场上所有友军持续12秒，持续时间内使“皇家近卫”受到的生命损耗降低75%，并且所有友军受到的伤害的70%平均分摊给所有存活的“皇家近卫”。若此时场上存活的“皇家近卫”近卫低于2名则召唤一名新的“皇家近卫”加入战斗。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":55,"end":60,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“皇家近卫”继承的生命值提升至佩吉的130% + 16%，攻击力提升至佩吉的55% + 7%。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“皇家近卫”继承的生命值提升至佩吉的140% + 16%，攻击力提升至佩吉的60% + 7%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“皇家近卫”继承的生命值提升至佩吉的150% + 16%，攻击力提升至佩吉的65% + 7%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“皇家近卫”继承的生命值提升至佩吉的160% + 16%，攻击力提升至佩吉的70% + 7%。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":41,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","皇家卷轴"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为皇家近卫和队友回复生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","佩吉展开魔法卷轴，对自己在场的全部“皇家近卫”，以及其余2名最虚弱的友军每秒回复佩吉150% + 18% ATK的生命值，持续8秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/c